&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;ATTN: Square/Sony this is freely available fan art. If there&amp;#39;s a problem, please just tell me to take it down. These have not been nor will they ever be made available for sale.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Some of you know I did Jenova a while back. Well I wanted the whole crew but the only one I found was low poly, or the collection listed below which is nice but I wanted a bit more detail. About half of this project is a remix, I did check and am allowed to remix the parts I did use. Huge shoutout to the original sculptors.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;For those wanting these but don&amp;#39;t have a 3d printer, you can use a print service.
